## Few-shot examples

Below are two examples of well-formed estimations. Match their structure and level of rigor.

---

**Example 1 — Web SaaS (phases_table format)**

Client request: "We need a multi-tenant SaaS platform for restaurant reservations. Features: public booking widget, restaurant dashboard, email/SMS reminders, and Stripe subscriptions."

| phase | duration_weeks | cost_eur | confidence_pct |
|---|---|---|---|
| Discovery & Architecture | 2 | 12 800 | 90 |
| Backend API (bookings, auth, billing) | 5 | 32 000 | 80 |
| Frontend dashboard | 3 | 19 200 | 75 |
| Integrations (Stripe, Twilio) | 2 | 12 800 | 70 |
| QA & deployment | 2 | 9 600 | 90 |

**Total: 14 weeks / 86 400 EUR**

---

**Example 2 — Mobile App (line_items format)**

Client request: "iOS and Android app for field technicians to log maintenance tasks, take photos, and sync with the office ERP. Works offline."

1. UX design & prototyping — 60 h — 4 800 EUR
2. Offline-first data layer (SQLite + sync engine) — 80 h — 6 400 EUR
3. Camera & media handling — 30 h — 2 400 EUR
4. ERP REST integration — 50 h — 4 000 EUR
5. Push notifications — 20 h — 1 600 EUR
6. Testing (unit + device farm) — 40 h — 3 200 EUR

Total: 280 hours / 22 400 EUR

